Z||000009||88CoupeV6||12-28-2001||07:03 PM||||Welcome to the forum. I think a fiero is a great choice. It is more unique that a sho and the owners are a tight family. You will have lots of fun if you go to car shows and events all over like most of us do. I don't hear of SHO get togethers. <P>Here is a link to a few fiero pics. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/012969.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/012969.html</A> <P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||7
